172 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 120 0 R
/T (My name is Preston Koeninger, and I am the Founder and President of THRILL. For years, I have been fascinated by how roller coasters work, and as that passion grew, I decided I wanted to make a career out of it. This led me to intensive research, connecting with industry professionals, and even touring Gravity Group, a roller coaster manufacturing facility in Cincinnati. As college drew nearer, I knew engineering was the path that would give me the tools and knowledge to succeed in this industry, and the University of Louisville had the program to get me there. When I arrived on campus, I noticed something was missing: a group dedicated to roller coaster engineering and the amusement industry. The more flyers I hung up and the more conversations I had, the more people I met who would enjoy and find benefit in a group like THRILL. While THRILL is still young, I see enormous potential, not only in the group itself, but more importantly in the individual members.)
/E (My name is Preston Koeninger, and I am the Founder and President of THRILL. For years, I have been fascinated by how roller coasters work, and as that passion grew, I decided I wanted to make a career out of it. This led me to intensive research, connecting with industry professionals, and even touring Gravity Group, a roller coaster manufacturing facility in Cincinnati. As college drew nearer, I knew engineering was the path that would give me the tools and knowledge to succeed in this industry, and the University of Louisville had the program to get me there. When I arrived on campus, I noticed something was missing: a group dedicated to roller coaster engineering and the amusement industry. The more flyers I hung up and the more conversations I had, the more people I met who would enjoy and find benefit in a group like THRILL. While THRILL is still young, I see enormous potential, not only in the group itself, but more importantly in the individual members.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
