/T (\(REC\), the group decided to theme the wooden coaster on local cryptid, the Pope Lick Monster. The process so far has involved making rough sketches on whiteboards, and transforming it into real concept art. Our next step was creating physical models using aluminum foil and clay. These models are just prototypes of what will be displayed on our finished model. )
