/P 123 0 R
/T ( Wyckoff: Why should UofL students pay Kentucky Kingdom a visit, or maybe even buy a Gold Pass?)
/E ( Wyckoff: Why should UofL students pay Kentucky Kingdom a visit, or maybe even buy a Gold Pass?)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
263 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 123 0 R
/T ( Atkinson: If you're at Louisville, or you're part of THRILL at UofL, you should really pay us a visit. We're your home park, and we're here for you. I was on campus about a month ago handing out free tickets to students at the Student Activities Center. The Kingdom has your back. I just graduated from college, so I know midterms and finals are tough. The best thing that got me through them was roller coasters, flat rides, and being around thousands of people who are all here for a common goal: creating memories worth repeating. It's maybe a five to seven minute drive from campus, maybe even less. Every season pass, whether it's Gold, Diamond, or Silver, comes with free parking and unlimited admission from the start of May all the way through the first week of January. )
/E ( Atkinson: If you're at Louisville, or you're part of THRILL at UofL, you should really pay us a visit. We're your home park, and we're here for you. I was on campus about a month ago handing out free tickets to students at the Student Activities Center. The Kingdom has your back. I just graduated from college, so I know midterms and finals are tough. The best thing that got me through them was roller coasters, flat rides, and being around thousands of people who are all here for a common goal: creating memories worth repeating. It's maybe a five to seven minute drive from campus, maybe even less. Every season pass, whether it's Gold, Diamond, or Silver, comes with free parking and unlimited admission from the start of May all the way through the first week of January. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
