/Title (Welcome to Industry Inversion, a student-led newsletter run by the Themed Rides Industry Leaders of Louisville \(THRILL@UofL\). Students with THRILL at the University of Louisville contribute articles on industry events, announcements, park reviews, engineering deep dives, and more. THRILL is a non-profit Registered Student Organization at the University of Louisville focused on the amusement industry, roller coasters, engineering, and everything in between.)
