/Title (James Atkinson II grew up in Louisville and calls Kentucky Kingdom his home park. He started there as a ride operator in 2023. Now in his fourth season, he's the park's Marketing and Sales Coordinator, and he's a lifetime passholder. Atkinson spoke to THRILL members at ESSRB earlier this semester. This fall, AJ and Micah caught up with him at the park during Pumpkins at Kentucky Kingdom to talk about the fall lineup, his favorite coaster, and why UofL students should make the short drive over. This interview has been lightly edited for length and clarity. The full interview can be viewed on THRILL's social media at @thrill.uofl.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 593 0 R
/Next 678 0 R
