/Title (For our first competition since the formation of THRILL in Fall of 2026, the group hopes to compete in the Engineering Ride Competition hosted this year at Hersheypark in Hershey Pennsylvania \(see left\). The Ride Engineering Competition \(REC\) is a competition where students work in teams to design and develop a themed amusement ride. Teams combine engineering, creativity, and storytelling to create a ride experience similar to that at full scale.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 588 0 R
