/Title (In our first month, THRILL has already accomplished more than I could have ever imagined. We have registered a team for the national Ride Engineering Competition next spring, lined up multiple guest speakers with more to come, planned a facility tour at Kentucky Kingdom, and now officially published our first issue of Industry Inversion!)
