/Title (The Pope Lick Monster is a creature from Louisville, Kentucky, said to live near the Pope Lick railway trestle. According to local legend, the monster is a goat-like creature with human features. Stories claim that it uses hypnosis to lure people onto the railroad tracks so that they cannot escape. Although there is no evidence that the monster actually exists, the legend has become a well-known part of Louisville's history and local folklore.)
