/Title (Atkinson: This upcoming season has a lot going on. Pumpkins at Kentucky Kingdom featuring the original Jack O'Lantern Spectacular is continuing. Kentucky Kingdom and Hurricane Bay are both on the same admission and open at the same time. Christmas at Kentucky Kingdom is coming up. There's so much to look forward to, and you can bet on it being a pretty great season next year at Kentucky Kingdom.)
