713 0 obj
<<
/Title (Atkinson: This is an easy answer for me. My first title here was ride operator on Wind Chaser in 2023, and it's my favorite coaster. I'd have to check my log, but I hit 2,726 lifetime rides on it during Louder Than Life, which we're also open for. That's my ride. Every twisting corner of it. I operated it, and now I help people film on it and talk about it. It's one of the smaller RMCs, but as a wise man once said, a small RMC is still an elite ride.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 593 0 R
/Prev 712 0 R
/Next 703 0 R
>>
